    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374820/extras/95b2aa2526a1365fda525f016ec70817.avif?t=1735657323\" width=594 height=65 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever wondered what it would be like to play pong on ice? Welcome to Hockey Pong ladies and gentleman.\u00a0 Hockey Pong is the first game of many to be released by Rayner Games Co. Hockey Pong is a fun mix between the game &quot;Pong&quot; and the game of hockey. If you love Pong and hockey this game was made for you eh!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-player</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the CPU and be the first to score 10 goals to win!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Co-op</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play versus your friends, family, brother or even your pet cat in this head to head local co-op mode.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374820/extras/95b2aa2526a1365fda525f016ec70817.avif?t=1735657323\" width=594 height=65 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever wondered what it would be like to play pong on ice? Welcome to Hockey Pong ladies and gentleman.\u00a0 Hockey Pong is the first game of many to be released by Rayner Games Co. Hockey Pong is a fun mix between the game &quot;Pong&quot; and the game of hockey. If you love Pong and hockey this game was made for you eh!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-player</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the CPU and be the first to score 10 goals to win!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Co-op</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play versus your friends, family, brother or even your pet cat in this head to head local co-op mode.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
